# Files matching these patterns get structure-only embedding (headline + structure)
# instead of full-text chunked embedding. This reduces embedding cost for files
# where semantic search of the full text provides little value.

# Vendored/third-party libraries
**/wwwroot/lib/**
**/vendor/**
**/vendors/**
**/third_party/**
**/third-party/**
**/node_modules/**
**/bower_components/**

# Minified files
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.min.map

# Bundles and compiled assets
**/dist/**/*.js
**/dist/**/*.css
**/build/**/*.js
**/build/**/*.css
**/*.bundle.js
**/*.bundle.css

# Package lock files (large JSON, low semantic value)
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/composer.lock
**/Cargo.lock
**/Gemfile.lock
**/poetry.lock

# Generated code
**/*.generated.cs
**/*.g.cs
**/*.Designer.cs
